:: OC Patrick and Felix Soccer [nobr]

/* Intro */
You spot a pair playing soccer in the distance and decide to sit on the grass nearby and watch for some relaxing viewing. Interestingly enough, you realize that you know both members of this 1-on-1 match. Currently playing the role of striker is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>, which is the least surprising thing you’ve seen, while currently defending the goal is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>, the popular kid with an open secret in his bottoms. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You lie back and watch as the two have an amusing back and forth game.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Felix",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Patrick",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

While <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> has some skill on the pitch, it is easily overshadowed by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>’s endless experience with the ball. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> pulls ahead as they switch back and forth between kicker and defender. Then, right at the winning goal, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> sends a kick to the lower left of the net! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> dives, managing to block it just in time… <span style="Color: Pink">but loses his bottoms in the process. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Haha! Nice try, but I stopped that one!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> says happily as he stands up, not realizing his lack of lower clothing which exposes his puffy diaper to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> and anyone else who’d be watching.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Told you I could turn this game around!”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Felix",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Patrick",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
                PantsDown: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Uhhh, nice job, but…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> looks a little nervous, pointing down at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>’s exposed padding. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> <span style="Color: Pink">looks down in confusion before laughing.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whoopsie, haha. Didn’t even notice! Where’d my bottoms go?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> spins around towards his bottoms, <span style="Color: Pink">walking over there and picking them up without shame before smiling and wiggling his butt towards <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe I should keep them off. You know, for good luck?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I respect the lack of shame, but that’s quite the clothing choice.”</span> He laughs nervously, rubbing the back of his head. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> <span style="Color: Pink">states how much he loves diapers and begins to list his many reasons for thinking so. By the end, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> is amused and shrugs as he goes to retrieve the ball.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You do you, dude. I’d have to lose a wild bet to wear something like that. Haha.”</span> <br>
<br>
Though you understand <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>’s words to be playful banter, it does seem to give <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> an idea. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You have a feeling he is going to try to throw some bets <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span>’s way in the near future.</span> <br>
<<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
<<needChange "Fun" 20>>
<br>
